<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body class="page-about">
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
        <h1>A diversified partner, run like nine specialist ones.</h1>
        <p class="hero-lede">
          3N Infinity Solutionz is a multi-sector B2B enterprise operating across India and the UAE,
          combining renewable energy technology, industrial supply and corporate services under a
          single accountable business.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-body">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="content-block">
          <h2>What we do</h2>
          <p>
            We operate nine core competencies spanning three divisions &mdash; Energy &amp; Sustainability,
            Industrial &amp; Trading, and Corporate &amp; Hospitality. Each division is run with its own
            specification standards and contract model, from robotic solar-panel cleaning AMCs to
            scheduled cotton and yarn supply, hygiene consumables, hospitality amenities, printing and
            packaging lines, solar EPC projects, and structured metal scrap trading.
          </p>
          <p>
            The model is deliberate: rather than a broker aggregating unrelated catalogues, each
            division is backed by direct manufacturing capability, in-house robotic technology, or
            verified long-term supplier partnerships &mdash; so clients get specialist-level execution
            without managing nine separate vendor relationships.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="content-block">
          <h2>How we operate</h2>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Contract and AMC-based delivery for recurring B2B relationships</li>
            <li>Direct sourcing and manufacturing relationships, not resale markups</li>
            <li>Dual-country operations across India and the UAE</li>
            <li>Dedicated points of contact per division, with one master account for multi-sector clients</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="container">
        <div class="pillars-grid">
          <% company.pillars.forEach(function(p){ %>
            <div class="pillar-card">
              <h3><%= p.title %></h3>
              <p><%= p.body %></p>
            </div>
          <% }) %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band">
      <div class="container cta-band-inner">
        <div>
          <h2>Want the full sector directory first?</h2>
          <p>See all nine competencies grouped by division.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/sectors" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Browse sectors</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
